{"type":"message","id":"b5cf650a","parentId":"8d812ce7","timestamp":"2026-02-17T17:53:56.016Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_d14837cf36a94aac802ea314","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"error\": \"missing_brave_api_key\",\n  \"message\": \"web_search needs a Brave Search API key. Run `openclaw configure --section web` to store it, or set BRAVE_API_KEY in the Gateway environment.\",\n  \"docs\": \"https://docs.openclaw.ai/tools/web\"\n}"}],"details":{"error":"missing_brave_api_key","message":"web_search needs a Brave Search API key. Run `openclaw configure --section web` to store it, or set BRAVE_API_KEY in the Gateway environment.","docs":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/tools/web"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771350836015}}
{"type":"message","id":"d2854041","parentId":"b5cf650a","timestamp":"2026-02-17T17:54:00.323Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Web search isn't available without API key. Let me try to look for OpenClaw documentation in other ways. Maybe I should check if there's any information in the workspace itself or if I can create the guide based on my understanding from the context provided.\n\nFrom the context I have:\n- OpenClaw is an agent system\n- It has a Gateway (control plane)\n- It has Agents (main vs subagents)\n- It has Channels (WhatsApp, Telegram, etc.)\n- It has Tools (browser, exec, memory, etc.)\n- It has Skills and plugins\n- It uses a workspace-based file system for persistence\n- It supports subagents with isolation\n- It has a configuration hierarchy\n- It uses sessions and routing\n\nBased on the AGENTS.md file and the runtime context, I can infer a lot about the architecture. Let me also check if there are any other files that might provide more technical details.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5c4dbeab878143a8809a1742","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"Get-ChildItem -Path \"D:\\workspace\\appDev\\openclaw\\workspace-osint\" -Force"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":13015,"output":462,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1771350836016}}
